# Privacy Policy for Spider

Effective Date: [Put Date]

Welcome to Spider.

Spider ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting users' personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use the Spider mobile application.

## Information We Collect

We may collect the following information:

### Personal Information
- Full name
- Email address
- Phone number
- Profile information
- Delivery address

### Account Information
- Login credentials
- User account details

### Order Information
- Order history
- Purchase details
- Payment information

### Device Information
- Device type
- Operating system
- App version
- Device identifiers

### Location Information
Spider may request access to your location to:
- Improve delivery services
- Display nearby stores
- Provide location-based features

Location access is only used with your permission.

## How We Use Information

We use collected information to:

- Create and manage user accounts
- Process orders and payments
- Improve user experience
- Provide customer support
- Send notifications related to orders and services
- Improve application performance
- Maintain security and prevent fraud

## Sharing Information

We do not sell users' personal information.

We may share information with:

- Vendors registered on the platform
- Delivery providers
- Payment service providers
- Service providers that help operate the application
- Legal authorities if required by law

## Data Security

We implement appropriate security measures to protect user information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

However, no internet transmission method is completely secure.

## Data Retention

We retain personal information only as long as necessary for operational, legal, and security purposes.

## User Rights

Users may:

- Access their personal information
- Request correction of inaccurate information
- Request deletion of their account and personal data
- Withdraw permissions such as location access

## Children's Privacy

Spider is not intended for children under 13 years old, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## Third-Party Services

The application may use third-party services such as:

- Firebase
- Google Play Services
- Payment gateways
- Analytics services

These services may collect information according to their own privacy policies.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updates will be reflected on this page.

